<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st/2.1.0> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0438-6831> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Spatiotemporal module is part of the LCAnet ontology proposed by the SmartACV Carnot Project.\n            It provides a formal representation of spatial and temporal aspects relevant to the LCA process,\n            enabling the modeling and integration of location- and time-specific data for products or services.\n            For the temporal aspect, it reuses classes and properties by importing the Time ontology: Time instant,\n            Time interval, and DurationDescription. For the spatial aspect, it aligns with some pre-defined classes \n            from other ontologies such as the Feature class from the geonames vocabulary." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-04-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <https://www.cea.fr> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "The Spatiotemporal module of the Life Cycle Assessment Network Ontology (LCAnet)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "st" .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#" .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LCAnet-Spatiotemporal" .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.1.0" .
