# http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasDuration
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasDuration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/2006/time#hasDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentProperty> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasDuration> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasCoordinates
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasCoordinates> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasCoordinates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasCoordinates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GeoPoint> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasCoordinates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Associates a location with a geographic point defined by WGS84 latitude and longitude.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasCoordinates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has coordinates" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasDuration
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasDuration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#DurationDescription> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Specifies the duration of a temporal entity such as a process or interval.\n            Directly corresponds to time:hasDuration.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has duration" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasLocation
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Relates an entity to a geographic location (Administrative Region or Site) where it takes place or exists.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has location" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasSpatialLocation
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasSpatialLocation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasSpatialLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasSpatialLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#SpatialScale> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasSpatialLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Indicates the level of spatial granularity (e.g., global, national, regional, local)\n            at which a location or LCA dataset is defined.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasSpatialLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has spatial scale" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalExtent
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalExtent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalExtent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalExtent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Interval> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalExtent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Relates an entity to the time interval during which it exists, occurs, or is valid.\n            Aligned with time:Interval.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalExtent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has temporal extent" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalResolution
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalResolution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalResolution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalResolution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#DurationDescription> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalResolution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Indicates the temporal granularity or resolution at which data or observations\n            are aggregated or reported (e.g., hourly, monthly, yearly).\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#hasTemporalResolution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has temporal resolution" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#inRegion
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#inRegion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#inRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#inRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#AdministrativeRegion> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#inRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Relates any entity (e.g., process, facility, emission) to an administrative\n            region where it occurs or is assessed.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#inRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "in region" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#locatedIn
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#locatedIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#locatedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#locatedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#AdministrativeRegion> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#locatedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Indicates that a location is contained within an administrative region (not a Site),\n            such as a city located in a province or country.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#locatedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "located in" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#occursAt
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#occursAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#occursAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#occursAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Instant> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#occursAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Relates an event or process to a specific temporal instant.\n            Aligns conceptually with time:Instant.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#occursAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "occurs at" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#validDuring
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#validDuring> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#validDuring> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#validDuring> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Interval> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#validDuring> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Indicates the temporal interval for which a dataset, measurement, or assessment is valid.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#validDuring> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "valid during" .
