<https://schema.org/Place> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://schema.org/Place> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#AdministrativeRegion
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#AdministrativeRegion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#AdministrativeRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://schema.org/AdministrativeArea> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#AdministrativeRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#AdministrativeRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A political or administrative territorial unit, such as a country, state, province, or city.\n        Aligns with schema:AdministrativeArea and gn:Feature." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#AdministrativeRegion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Administrative Region" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GeoPoint
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GeoPoint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GeoPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A geographic point represented by WGS84 latitude and longitude coordinates." .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GeoPoint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GeoPoint" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GlobalScale
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GlobalScale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GlobalScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#SpatialScale> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#GlobalScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Global Scale" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#LocalScale
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#LocalScale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#LocalScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#SpatialScale> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#LocalScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Local Scale" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#SpatialThing> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A general spatial entity representing any identifiable place or geographic feature.\n            Equivalent to schema:Place and gn:Feature.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Location" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#NationalScale
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#NationalScale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#NationalScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#SpatialScale> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#NationalScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "National Scale" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#RegionalScale
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#RegionalScale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#RegionalScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#SpatialScale> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#RegionalScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Regional Scale" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Site
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Site> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Site> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Location> .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Site> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            A specific location associated with an activity, facility, installation, or process.\n            Examples: LCA process site, production site, waste treatment site.\n        " .
<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#Site> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Site" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#SpatialScale
