<https://w3id.org/lcanet/st#SpatialScale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            A classification of the level of spatial granularity applied in an LCA study,\n            such as global, continental, national, regional, or local scale.\n            Used for specifying the spatial resolution of data or impacts.\n        " .
